          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Despite any stigma against it, I have always found the potential of "Tenth Walker" fics to be incredibly fascinating, and have only encountered two in my life that not only completed the story but that I felt were worth the read. That being said, despite having made it to the end of the War of the Ring, neither of these stories conclusions sat well with me for a series of personal reasons.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;So after an image of a particular character joining the Fellowship found its way into my mind, I have decided to give it a go for myself. My only hope is that the reader finds as much enjoyment in reading the story as I have writing it.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Hotshot95</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mature</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Lord of the Rings - All Media Types</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Aragorn | Estel</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Legolas Greenleaf</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Gimli (Son of GlÃ³in)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Gandalf | Mithrandir</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Merry Brandybuck</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pippin Took</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Frodo Baggins</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sam Gamgee</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Boromir (Son of Denethor II)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Action/Adventure</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Portal Sends Catra to Middle-Earth</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Blend of Book and Movie canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternative Character Development Path</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>So therefore a Potential OOC Warning</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Your Milage May Very</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Swears Like a Sailor</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She basically grew up in a military cult so that's a given</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>headcanons ahoy!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Possibly the Strangest Idea I've Ever Put Down</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>It Basically Popped Into My Head One Night and Wouldn't Leave</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I REGERET NOTHING</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>canon character death</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Does that still count towards the Major Character Death tag?</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Meaningful Renames</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Guest Starring: A Mystery Third Fandom</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Apart from the Emotional Core this is more for Fun than Anything Else</rdf:li>
